        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    Note over Admin,Correo: CU-04 - Crear Usuario\n    participant Admin as Administrador (sysadmin)\n    participant Vue as Vue Frontend (Form.vue)\n    participant Controller as UserController\n    participant PostgreSQL\n    participant Correo as Servicio de Correo\n\n    Admin-&gt;&gt;Vue: 1. Click &quot;Nuevo Usuario&quot;\n    Vue-&gt;&gt;Controller: 2. GET /admin/users/create\n    Controller-&gt;&gt;PostgreSQL: 3. Cargar roles y areas\n    Controller--&gt;&gt;Vue: 4. Renderizar formulario\n    Admin-&gt;&gt;Vue: 5. Completar datos\n    Admin-&gt;&gt;Vue: 6. Click &quot;Guardar&quot;\n    Vue-&gt;&gt;Controller: 7. POST /admin/users\n    Controller-&gt;&gt;PostgreSQL: 8. Validar unicidad coord. por area\n    Controller-&gt;&gt;PostgreSQL: 9. DB::transaction()\n    Note over Controller,PostgreSQL: a. Generar password (16ch)&lt;br/&gt;b. Hash Argon2id&lt;br/&gt;c. Generar kdf_salt&lt;br/&gt;d. INSERT users&lt;br/&gt;e. INSERT role_user&lt;br/&gt;f. INSERT profesionales\n    Controller-&gt;&gt;PostgreSQL: 10. COMMIT\n    Controller-&gt;&gt;Correo: 11. Enviar UserCreatedNotification\n    Note over Controller,Correo: URL firmada temporal (24h)\n    Controller--&gt;&gt;Vue: 12. Redirect 302 /admin/users\n    Vue--&gt;&gt;Admin: 13. Tabla actualizada&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="cu04-seq">
